{"seq":2,"slug":"parts-tools-mobile-inventory","title":"备件工具管理：物料需求、随车库存与领用扣减","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/field-execution-delivery/parts-tools-mobile-inventory","wordCount":2930,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"备件工具管理-物料需求-随车库存与领用扣减\">备件工具管理：物料需求、随车库存与领用扣减</h1><p>一次「技师到场，发现少了一颗 M8 膨胀螺栓」，在账面上是几毛钱的差异，在履约上是一次二次上门、一个差评、一段被浪费的两小时窗口。备件与工具管理的全部复杂度，就是让随车那一小格库存，在门铃响起之前恰好等于这张工单的物料需求，并在事后精确地扣减回去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-备件与工具是两条不同的库存流\">核心概念：备件与工具是两条不同的库存流</h2><p>现场服务里最容易犯的设计错误，是把「备件」和「工具」塞进同一张库存表，用同一个数量字段管理。它们的语义根本不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>备件（parts）是被消耗的物料。</strong> 一次领用即一次永久出库，扣减后不会回来。管理目标是「账实一致」——系统里的数量必须等于车里实际能用的数量。</li>\n<li><strong>工具（tools）是被借用的资产。</strong> 用完要归还到池子，可能跨技师、跨车辆流转。计量器具（扭矩扳手、绝缘电阻表）还必须跟踪校准有效期，过期即不可用于验收。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者共用一个事实：<strong>它们的可用性是容量的前置条件</strong>。预约系统里那个「9:00–11:00」的格子之所以能开卖，其中一个必要条件是「该技师的车里今天有这套 BOM 的全部件」（见 <a href=\"../appointment-technician-dispatch/appointment-slot-capacity-model\">预约时段模型</a>）。备件管理的失效，会直接表现为调度层的容量虚高。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[安装工单&lt;br/&gt;SKU + 型号 + 安装类型] --&gt; B[service BOM&lt;br/&gt;explosion 展开]&#10;  B --&gt; C[物料需求清单&lt;br/&gt;件号 + 数量 + 单位]&#10;  C --&gt; D{随车库存校验}&#10;  D --&gt;|齐套| E[技师出发&lt;br/&gt;锁定该车该窗容量]&#10;  D --&gt;|缺件| F[缺件处理&lt;br/&gt;区域仓调拨 / 改期 / 换车]&#10;  E --&gt; G[现场领用]&#10;  G --&gt; H[扫码扣减&lt;br/&gt;车辆库位 -n]&#10;  H --&gt; I[低于补货点&lt;br/&gt;触发随车补货]&#10;  I --&gt; J[回仓装车&lt;br/&gt;入库校验 账实一致]\">graph TD\n  A[安装工单&lt;br/&gt;SKU + 型号 + 安装类型] --&gt; B[service BOM&lt;br/&gt;explosion 展开]\n  B --&gt; C[物料需求清单&lt;br/&gt;件号 + 数量 + 单位]\n  C --&gt; D{随车库存校验}\n  D --&gt;|齐套| E[技师出发&lt;br/&gt;锁定该车该窗容量]\n  D --&gt;|缺件| F[缺件处理&lt;br/&gt;区域仓调拨 / 改期 / 换车]\n  E --&gt; G[现场领用]\n  G --&gt; H[扫码扣减&lt;br/&gt;车辆库位 -n]\n  H --&gt; I[低于补货点&lt;br/&gt;触发随车补货]\n  I --&gt; J[回仓装车&lt;br/&gt;入库校验 账实一致]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>备件</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有权流转</td>\n<td>一次领用即出库</td>\n<td>借出后须归还</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主计量</td>\n<td>数量（件）</td>\n<td>资产编号（唯一实例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键状态</td>\n<td>在库 / 在途 / 已消耗</td>\n<td>在池 / 随车 / 校准中 / 报废</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺货后果</td>\n<td>二次上门</td>\n<td>无法施工或无法验收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"物料需求-从安装-bom-到工单需求展开\">物料需求：从安装 BOM 到工单需求展开</h2><p>物料需求靠 BOM（Bill of Materials）表达。安装服务的 BOM 是 <strong>service BOM</strong>——维基百科把它定义为「产品被维护时的样子」（the product as maintained），与工程 BOM（设计时）、销售 BOM（下单时）、制造 BOM（制造时）并列（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_of_materials\">Bill of materials</a>）。BOM 是层级结构：<strong>explosion</strong> 把装配件拆解到零件（壁挂架 → 底座板 + 膨胀螺栓 ×4 + 垫片），<strong>implosion</strong> 反向追溯某个零件被哪些装配用到。安装工单只需要展开到「可领用件」这一层的扁平列表。</p>\n<p>工单的物料需求不是常量，而是「产品型号 × 安装类型 × 现场条件」的函数。同一台 75 吋电视，「壁挂（轻质墙）」和「壁挂（砖墙）」的 BOM 完全不同——前者用普通膨胀螺栓，后者可能要化学锚栓。因此需求展开必须发生在<strong>派单之后、出发之前</strong>，而不是在客户下单时估一个固定值。</p>\n<p>需求展开有两个工程必需字段：<strong>件号（可领用最小单位）<strong>与</strong>需求量</strong>。件号在跨境场景里必须锚定到 GS1 的 <strong>GTIN</strong>——它「在全世界唯一标识一个产品，是 GS1 体系的基础」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GS1\">GS1</a>）；小件常用 GS1 <strong>DataMatrix</strong> 码直接标在包装上，便于扫码领用。用内部自编号会切断这条与上游对账的链。</p>\n<p>一条固定规则：<strong>需求清单只认「可领用件号」</strong>。把「壁挂架组件」和「膨胀螺栓」两个层级混在一张清单里，扣减时就会出现「组件已扣、但单件仍显示在库」的双重计数。另一个隐蔽来源是<strong>冗余领用</strong>——技师多带 1–2 件易损件以防现场损坏是合理的运营缓冲，但必须在系统里显式建模为「车辆库位保有量」的一部分，而不是记成「已消耗」，否则螺栓会凭空消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随车库存-车辆库位的容量模型与补货触发\">随车库存：车辆库位的容量模型与补货触发</h2><p>随车库存（van stock / trunk stock）是一个<strong>移动的微型仓库</strong>。它的容量受物理约束：车厢体积、载重、库位格数。补货模型直接借用经典库存理论。</p>\n<p>**补货点（reorder point）<strong>与</strong>安全库存（safety stock）**决定了「车里剩多少就该补」。需求与提前期都不确定时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z_\\alpha \\sqrt{E(L)\\,\\sigma_D^2 + \\big(E(D)\\big)^2 \\sigma_L^2}, \\qquad ROP = E(L)\\,E(D) + SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.4541em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3859em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3459em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4541em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是周期平均需求、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是需求标准差、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均补货提前期、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提前期标准差、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标服务水平对应的标准正态分位数——95% 服务水平约取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_\\alpha = 1.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.65</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock\">Safety stock</a>）。提前期固定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z_\\alpha \\sigma_D \\sqrt{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0767em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>批量决策用 EOQ</strong>：补货固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、单位年持有成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、年需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 时，最优批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^* = \\sqrt{2DK/h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最小总成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\min} = \\sqrt{2hDK} + PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_order_quantity\">Economic order quantity</a>）。但该模型假设需求恒定、一次到货、无数量折扣、单一品种——在随车场景里几乎全不成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只作量级参考。</p>\n<p>真正落地的关键是<strong>分级</strong>。ABC 分析按重要性把库存分层：典型切分是 A 类占 20% 品类 / 70% 价值、B 类 30% / 25%、C 类 50% / 5%，A 类需要「极紧的控制与精确记录」，C 类「用最简控制和最少记录」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ABC_analysis\">ABC analysis</a>）。一个被引用的政策例子显示：对 A/B/C 分别采用每周、每两周、每月的补货节奏后，四周内配送次数从 16000 降到 5000，平均库存从 2.5 周降到 1.925 周——约 23% 库存下降与 69% 配送频次下降。<strong>随车库存照搬这个分层</strong>：把「车没它就不能施工」的件（壁挂件、电源线、密封件）列 A 类保底常在，长尾小件按 C 类管理、允许缺货改由区域仓次日达。</p>\n<p>补货触发点有三类，任一到阈值即触发：<strong>数量触发</strong>（某件低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，进入当日补货清单）、<strong>工单触发</strong>（今晚排班里出现需要该件的工单，反查车辆库位是否齐套）、<strong>事件触发</strong>（车辆中途丢件、损件、被交叉调拨出去）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"领用扣减-扫码-批次与账实一致\">领用扣减：扫码、批次与账实一致</h2><p>扣减（consumption deduction）是整套系统里<strong>唯一真正的库存真相来源</strong>。它必须发生在施工完成的时刻、由执行人当场完成，而不是事后由调度补录。</p>\n<p>扣减链路：<strong>扫码识别件号 → 关联工单 → 写扣减流水 → 更新车辆库位余额</strong>。4 条工程约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>扣减必须幂等。</strong> 弱网下技师可能重复点击。扣减流水带唯一键（<code>工单ID + 件号 + 批次 + 序号</code>），重放不重复扣。</li>\n<li><strong>批次 / 序列号按需打开。</strong> 高价值或需追溯的件（燃气软管、安全阀）必须记序列号；螺栓这类 C 类件记到批次即止。</li>\n<li><strong>负库存要么禁止、要么显式告警。</strong> 允许静默负数等于放弃账实一致。正确做法是拦截并转入「盘点差异」流程，让人来定位是漏扣还是丢件。</li>\n<li><strong>未用可退（return-to-stock）。</strong> 冗余领用没耗掉的件，必须能原路退回车辆库位，否则冗余会系统性漂移成损耗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账实一致靠**循环盘点（cycle counting）**维护，而非年终大盘。ABC 分层的另一面就是盘点频次分层：A 类每月盘、C 类每季盘。盘点差异要归因到「漏扣、丢件、错件、批次混放」四类，否则盘点只是擦了擦表面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具管理-资产池-校准与借用链\">工具管理：资产池、校准与借用链</h2><p>工具的核心是<strong>唯一实例</strong>与<strong>状态机</strong>：每个实例有唯一资产号，状态在「在池 / 借出 / 随车 / 校准中 / 报废」之间流转，每次流转留痕。三个必须工程化的点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>计量校准有效期是硬约束。</strong> 扭矩扳手、绝缘测试仪等用于验收的量具，超出校准周期即不可用。系统应在派单时就校验「该技师名下的量具全部在有效期内」，而不是到场才发现。这属于调度层的硬约束（工具齐套），不可用软惩罚近似。</li>\n<li><strong>共享池与跨车调拨。</strong> 专用工具（高空作业平台、瓷砖切割机）数量有限、单价高，通常走共享池按需借用，而非每车一台。借用即产生一个「在某时段被某工单占用」的锁，与时段容量模型里的「工具配额」是同一个量。</li>\n<li><strong>损耗与遗失的责任链。</strong> 工具归还不等于工具可用，需回池检验（功能、校准、附件齐套）。遗失与人为损坏要走责任认定，否则池子会被慢慢掏空。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工具与备件在系统里的交集是<strong>随车清单（van kit）</strong>：每辆车的标准配置由「固定随车工具」+「工单专用工具」+「A 类备件保底量」三部分构成，是排班可行性的输入之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境场景的额外约束-vmi-寄售与关税\">跨境场景的额外约束：VMI、寄售与关税</h2><p>跨境安装服务的备件流比本地多出两层约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是所有权与结算。</strong> 备件未必由服务商买断。**VMI（供应商管理库存）**下，买方共享销售与库存数据、由「供应商作为决策者决定补货量」；**寄售（consignment）**是 VMI 的一种，货物「由零售商占有但未售出前不归零售商所有」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vendor-managed_inventory\">Vendor-managed inventory</a>）。跨境安装常采用寄售：品牌方的备件放在服务商的区域仓，消耗后才触发结算——寄售件不是服务商的资产，但要在库存系统里可查可扣。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是关税与合规。</strong> 备件跨境运输涉及 HS 编码归类与申报价值；安装用耗材（密封胶、化学锚栓）可能属于危险品或受成分管制，空运受限。合规约束会拉长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（提前期），从而直接抬高安全库存——这也解释了为什么跨境市场的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 通常显著高于本地。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是标准对齐。</strong> 用 GS1 的 <strong>GLN</strong>（全球位置码）标识区域仓与车辆服务点、用 <strong>SSCC</strong> 标识物流单元、用 GS1-128 承载多个应用标识符（AI 01 = GTIN，AI 17 = 有效期，AI 422 = 原产国，共 150+ 个 AI 定义），可以让一件备件从工厂到客户墙上的螺栓在同一条码链上被追踪（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GS1\">GS1</a>）。追踪粒度的投入应与备件的价值与安全等级成正比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>备件与工具是两条流</strong>：备件按数量消耗出库，工具按唯一实例借用归还；混在一张表里必然账实不符。</li>\n<li><strong>需求用 service BOM 展开</strong>，且发生在派单后、出发前；件号必须锚定到 GTIN 这类全局标识才能与上游对账。</li>\n<li><strong>随车库存是移动微型仓</strong>：补货点用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROP = E(L)E(D) + SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（安全库存按需求与提前期双变量方差计算），批量参考 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^* = \\sqrt{2DK/h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者都只作量级参考。</li>\n<li><strong>分级是落地的关键</strong>：ABC 分层决定补货节奏与盘点频次，A 类保底常在、C 类允许缺货靠区域仓兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>扣减是唯一的库存真相来源</strong>，必须幂等、当场、可退；负库存应拦截而非静默。</li>\n<li><strong>工具管理核心是状态机与校准有效期</strong>，量具过期即不可用于验收，属派单硬约束。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境多出所有权（VMI/寄售）、关税与标准对齐三层约束</strong>，合规会拉长提前期、推高安全库存。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：服务目录与 eligibility 规则见 <a href=\"../installation-service-catalog/\">第 1 章 服务目录</a>，预约与调度见 <a href=\"../appointment-technician-dispatch/\">第 2 章 预约与技师调度</a>，完工验收与售后见 <a href=\"../completion-aftersales/\">第 4 章 完工与售后</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"备件工具管理：物料需求、随车库存与领用扣减","id":"备件工具管理-物料需求-随车库存与领用扣减"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：备件与工具是两条不同的库存流","id":"核心概念-备件与工具是两条不同的库存流"},{"level":2,"text":"物料需求：从安装 BOM 到工单需求展开","id":"物料需求-从安装-bom-到工单需求展开"},{"level":2,"text":"随车库存：车辆库位的容量模型与补货触发","id":"随车库存-车辆库位的容量模型与补货触发"},{"level":2,"text":"领用扣减：扫码、批次与账实一致","id":"领用扣减-扫码-批次与账实一致"},{"level":2,"text":"工具管理：资产池、校准与借用链","id":"工具管理-资产池-校准与借用链"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景的额外约束：VMI、寄售与关税","id":"跨境场景的额外约束-vmi-寄售与关税"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现场工单状态机与作业证据留痕模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/field-execution-delivery/field-workorder-state-evidence"},"next":{"title":"现场异常处置：缺件、环境不达标与安全返工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/field-execution-delivery/onsite-exception-safety-rework"}}